// Adds `bone`'s draw object (+0x14) to the frame's draw list (the words from 0x805EA9A0, *0x800619B2 of them) unless it's there already: the list is searched, and when the object isn't found it is put at the end and the count goes up. The model builders call it for each bone they set up (27 callers). (2026-11-12: renamed from find_in_draw_list: the code shows what happens when it isn't found.)
