// From the N64 function at 0x8000A958 (20 instructions).
// Called by: superstar_size, fill_match_record_from_superstar, draw_superstar_profile.
// Random-tested: 200000 plain random inputs, all instructions reached, no difference. In play: 988 comparisons, no difference (caller twin v11, 0.84, match_tag, menu_from_attract, modes_reg_rumble (match not reached), modes_regular_boot, rules_single_hardcore, select_wcw, smoke_singles; see the header's caller-twin note).
