// Plays sound `sound` at full volume and centred (play_sound, func_8000367C) and returns its handle; numbers 0x401 to 0x42C are first mapped through the table at 0x80047B8C, and anything outside 0 to 0xB4 plays nothing. The mod plays the ring bell and the coin's sound with it (mod/src/logic.c).
