// Hides the HUD's count sprites (the bones at *0x8015379C and *0x8015387C) unless already hidden or the count (0x80153A84, NM_REF_COUNT) reached 3. Callers func_80114514, run_pin_count. (2026-11-12, names3: confirmed from the lifted C++: both draw objects | 0x80 only when the first is shown and *0x80153A84 < 3.)
// From the N64 function at 0x800E0158 (19 instructions).
// Called by: run_match_step, run_pin_count.
// Random-tested: 200000 plain random inputs, all instructions reached, no difference. In play: 16 comparisons, no difference (leaf twin, 0.84, match_tag, menu_from_attract, rules_single_hardcore, smoke_singles).
void hide_pin_count(void) {
    P<s32> count_object;
    P<s32> count_object_b;
    s32 count_object_flags;

    count_object = GAME_VAR(hud_pin_count_object);
    count_object_flags = *count_object;
    if (!(count_object_flags & 0x80) && (GAME_VAR(referee_count) < 3)) {
        *count_object = count_object_flags | 0x80;
        count_object_b = GAME_VAR(hud_popup_2);
        *count_object_b |= 0x80;
    }
}

// Shows the referee's count `count` (1-3) on the HUD unless the result is up (0x801594D0): when it changes (0x80153A84, NM_REF_COUNT in mod/src/commentary.c) plays its sound (table 0x80144C1E) and places its sprite (place_hud_quad_points: at 240, 10, white). Callers run_pin_count, wrestler_state_166_partner_save_166 (pin code). hide_pin_count takes it down. (2026-11-12, names3: confirmed from the lifted C++: nothing while *0x801594D0 is set or outside 1-3; a hidden pop-up (*0x8015379C | 0x80) resets 0x80153A84; a new count plays the halfword 0x80144C1E + 2 x count (play_menu_sound) and places the sprite at x 0xF0.)
