// For the picture record `picture` writes where its palette starts (record + 0x10) to *`palette` and where its pixels start (after the palette: + the 16-bit colour count at +0xA x 2) to *`pixels`. The layout menu_text_picture_data uses.
// From the N64 function at 0x800E0660 (8 instructions).
