// Shows picture `number` (0-11) of the Royal Rumble's entrance countdown banner on its part (0x80157E10, set_part_picture_pointers from the 8-byte pairs at 0x80157CD0) and shows its bones, unless it is already showing (0x80157F5C); numbers under 4 play a sound from the table at 0x80144C28 and 0 another (0x46). mod/NOTES.md (0.59.0): wrestler_state_163_rumble_entrant_walk_in (func_8011D848) calls it with 10 - count, the entrance countdown banner index. clear_rumble_countdown resets it.
