// Frees what a match area loaded: waits for the graphics thread, frees every slot's model (free_model_slot) and clears its flag byte 0x80525460, then free_match_object_models (func_80024AE4), free_ringside_objects, the bone list 0x80158F18, clear_rumble_queue, free_venue, free_animation_streams (func_80011EE0), the HUD's pictures (free_match_hud), the name boxes (close_name_boxes); 0x80047EB0 = 0. Called by run_match at an area change and at the end.
