// Fills the Controller Pak buffer (*0x80104BD0, zeroed) from the roster file (load_roster_files): for 18 records 0xB01 + i, four 0x44-byte costumes (func_8000B834 then pack_costume_for_save (func_800E299C)) at i x 0x114 with a checksum at +0x110, and a moveset (func_8000B914, copy_moveset_to_save (func_800E2AC0)) at 0x1368 + i x 0xDC with a checksum at +0xD8; then a checksum of the first 0x22E0 bytes at +0x22E0 (store_save_checksum). Caller save_to_controller_pak (a new note). IDs 0xB01-0xB12 are the Create-a-Wrestler edit buffers (mod/src/roster.c), so this fills a new note with their default contents.
