// In a tag match (0x800A957C & 4): looks for the u16 at 0x80097EEC among the words 0x8053BCA0 / 0x8053BCA4 / 0x8053BCA8 and returns 1 when the one it equals matches `arg0` & 3 (1, 2 or 3), else 2; outside tag matches `arg0` as it is. (2026-11-12, names4: renamed from story_wins and the about rewritten from the lifted C++: it is a 1 / 2 side code, not a count; the old reading came from mod/STORY_NOTES.md, unconfirmed. What the words are is not established.) (2026-11-14, fablenames: fields.json now names the words: 0x80097EEC is story_champion and 0x8053BCA0 / A4 / A8 the Superstars of match slots 0 / 1 / 2 (mod/src/ann_slot.h 'slot wrestler id'). So in a tag match the result is 1 when the slot that holds the story's champion is slot (`arg0` & 3) - 1, else 2; with match type bit 8 and the champion in slot 2, 1 and 2 are swapped. Left a guess: what the caller's 1 / 2 stand for is not established))
