// Returns `arg0` with 1 and 2 swapped (other values as they are) when the word 0x8053BCA0 differs from the u16 at 0x80097EF0, else `arg0` unchanged. (2026-11-12, names4: renamed from story_losses and the about rewritten from the lifted C++: the code is a 1 / 2 swap, not a count; the old about cited mod/STORY_NOTES.md, unconfirmed. What the two words are is not established.) (2026-11-14, fablenames: renamed from swap_one_two_unless_story_slot and confirmed: fields.json now names both words -- match_slot_superstars (slot 0's Superstar, 0x8053BCA0: 'slot wrestler id' in mod/src/ann_slot.h) and story_participant (0x80097EF0) -- so the name can say exactly what the lifted C++ does: 1 and 2 swapped unless slot 0 holds the story's participant))
