s32 swap_one_two_unless_participant_in_slot_0(s32 value) {
    s32 result;

    if (GAME_VAR(match_slot_superstars) != GAME_VAR(story_participant)) {
        result = 2;
        if (value != 1) {
            result = value;
            if (value == 2) {
                return 1;
            }
        }
        
        return result;
    }
    result = value;
    return result;
}

// When +0x8A bit 11 (0x800) is set: snap_to_rope_line (func_800EBBF4) puts his position on the rope line of his side +0x60 (x or z = +-265, the other from the body point) and returns 1; else 0. The taunt (27) then goes to standing (file 0x2DE1). Reading: +0x8A 0x800 = at the ropes. (2026-11-12, names4: confirmed from the lifted C++: the name says only what the code does).
