// Returns 1 while something holds the match's normal play: 0x8016B599 & 0x40, 0x8016B598 & 2, 0x8016B650 & 0x800 (unless 0x80097EC0 & 0x21000), any_wrestler_changing_area, or any wrestler in play in state 208 / 209 (the shove through a door) or 190; else 0. The guard (76) and the hold 127 end their wait on it as if the button were let go. Called by the state machine run_wrestler_state_step and 15 states. (2026-11-12, names2: renamed from match_scene_running -- it is no scene test; confirmed from the lifted C++.)
