// Called by: run_match, func_800D9AB0.
// Random-tested: 200000 plain random inputs, all instructions reached, no difference. In play: 1346 comparisons, no difference (caller twin v11, 0.84, match_tag, menu_from_attract, rules_single_hardcore, smoke_singles; see the header's caller-twin note).
