// Sizes the big-font text record `record` for its string (+0: the sum of its characters' widths, big_font_glyph_width): height 25 (+0xE), line width rounded up to 16 with a margin ((width + 0x12) & ~0xF, +0xC), the drawn width and the 4-bit picture's byte size (+8). Caller big_font_text_picture.
