// Splits a CPU move list (`count` 4-byte entries {s16 move, u8 flags}) into the moves usable now (flags bit 0) and the rest, as s32 lists; returns how many are usable. Used by the move-list pickers (ai_pick_ground_move_on_lying_target, ai_pick_dive_at_lying_target, ...).
