// Sets the CPU's current plan: in the AI record of the slot being decided (*0x8015A6F0, mod/src/gameplay.c NM_AI_CUR) +0x00 = `plan`, +0x04 / +0x08 = 0, +0x56 = his target's state at the time (*0x80159618 -> +0x14), and +0x80's low bits to 1 (a new plan). Each plan has a step in the table at 0x80145A10 (the ai_plan_N functions). Called from about 176 places.
// From the N64 function at 0x800FCEB4 (18 instructions).
