// For a target running at him (situation 2 / 3) and facing him, close: holds L (with the stick toward the ropes for moveset +0x34 0x100000 / 0x400000) until his own situation is 58 (state 29, the dodge) or 47 (78), then plan 15 (answer the runner). Called through the plan table 0x80145A10 by the CPU step func_800F03F0 while the AI record (*0x8015A6F0) +0x00 is the plan; +0x24 is his own situation code, +0x48 the target's (structs.md). Handed out by: ai_plan_15_answer_runner. (2026-11-12, names4: confirmed from the lifted C++: with AI +0x80 bit 6, close to the rope side behind him and a 70% roll the stick toward it is built; standing, facing the runner (facings over 0x400 apart) within 0x801505A0 he holds L (with the stick for moveset +0x34 & 0x100000, 50% for 0x400000), else walks the stick while the target runs (2 / 3); then waits 58 / 47 and hands over to plan 15).
