// Adds one to the per-slot score 0x8017D2F0 (six-man layout; stock 0x80159218, exe lifted_layout.h "team score part"; capped at 99; cleared for every slot at the match start by set_up_match_memory (func_80113E30)) for `scorer_slot`; if `loser` is given, his stamina (+0xAA) is raised to at least 60 and update_spirit_meter(loser, 7) runs. Callers: the hold (73) at its submission frame credits the holder (+0x08), the daze after a move (46) credits the man who hit him (+0x00), both only with the rule 0x800A9950 & 0x80000 and right after ringing the bell (play_menu_sound(1): mod/src/logic.c SFX_BELL); func_801166B8 / func_80116CDC (the pin / match-end checks) too. Reading: a fall in a match that counts falls and goes on (the Iron Man style rule 0x80000); the loser gets some stamina back to continue. (2026-11-12, names2: the code confirmed from the lifted C++.)
