// Plays menu sound `sound` (play_menu_sound) and, for sounds 0x415 and 0x41F, turns its volume down to 0x50 (set_sound_volume; the others stay at 0x80). Callers tick_intro_sound, play_intro_script. (2026-11-12, names3: confirmed from the lifted C++: the old about had the volume the wrong way round, only those two sounds are changed.)
