// One intro frame: play_intro_script, then the entry's fade (entry +2 & 0xF: 1-2 over 8 frames, 3-4 0x20, 5-6 0x40, 7-8 4 before its end time 0x8015C904, odd ones negated; 0xA black 0xFF by 0x20) into 0x801056D0; at the end time the next entry (0x8014B6A0 + 1) or, with flag 0x40, the intro's end (0x800457A0 = -1); 0x8014B6A8 marks the entry about to come; then the time 0x8015CCE0 advances by the speed 0x801064C0.
