// Copies intro entry `entry`'s four man words (entry record 0x8013046C + entry x 0x1C, +0xC on) into the intro men 0x8014B6B8 + i x 0x1C; a negative one clears that man (+0x14 = -1, +0x16 = 0). (2026-11-12, names4: confirmed from the lifted C++: the name says only what the code does).
// From the N64 function at 0x8011A918 (26 instructions).
// Called by: run_intro_frame.
