// Loads record `record`'s sprite (+4: +0xA texture file, +0xD / +0xE log2 width / height) texture for frame `frame_index` (effect_frame_texture (func_8011BF68_ovl_b), the effect texture cache) into the display list at *`list` (setimg / loadblock / settile / settilesize) and calls the sprite's own list (+0); nothing when there's no texture.
