// Called by: draw_effect_burst, draw_effect_record.
// Random-tested: 200000 plain random inputs, all instructions reached, no difference. In play: 416 comparisons, no difference (caller twin v11, 0.84, menu_from_attract, modes_reg_rumble (match not reached), modes_regular_boot, select_wcw; see the header's caller-twin note).
