// For the HUD: the meter 100 and the SPECIAL time +0xB0 while SPECIAL is ready, else his spirit kept within 1-99 (0 only in DANGER, +0xEE bit 0) and time 0; returns +0xEE bit 4. Called by update_hud_panels.
