// Draws a string in a style (draw_styled_text) into the span `xs` at `ys`: with flag 0x8000 centred (narrow_span_to_width), 0x4000 right-aligned (narrow_span_to_width_right), else at full width; the flags' low byte goes to draw_menu_picture_in_span (func_8011CE80).
