// While story-scene actor `actor`'s animation 0x8015CCCC[actor] is a walk (0xA, 0x22, 0x28: 4 a frame) or 0x16 (0xC a frame): turns him toward his walk target (place slot 4 + actor, 0x8015C890 + actor x 0x10) by 0x40 (turn_angle_toward_by), moves him up to that far toward it (gu_position_f, transform_point), and once there turns to the target's facing (by 0x80); there and facing -> state 0x80106450[actor] = 2.
