// The hit-reaction file by his hit flags +0x74 (0x100000 / 0x200000 / 0x400000 / 0x800000 / 0x1000000 -> 0x3115, 0x3117, 0x3119, 0x311B, 0x311D, one more with 0x02000000, hit from behind), else `file`; + 14 when his stamina is under 100. Used by the running collision (5) and the hit reaction (45).
