// `out = v * scale` for a three-float vector.
// From the N64 function at 0x8012EE4C (13 instructions).
// Called by: pick_whip_target, wrestler_state_208_shove_through_door, wrestler_state_170_mount_ladder, touch_and_push_worker and 9 more.
