// Puts the options 0x800A9468..0x800A946E into screen 17's rows 0, 1, 3 and screen 19's rows 0-2 (+0x4E); the reverse of store_screen_17_19_options. Caller init_menu_screen_17. (2026-11-12, names4: confirmed from the lifted C++: the name says only what the code does).
