// Puts pick `pick` (0x800A95A0, 12 bytes) into match slot `slot`: Superstar (0x8053BCA0), controller +3 (0x8054B7A0, pick_controller), costume +2 (0x8054B840), and with `extra` its 8 bytes from +4 into 0x8051BFC0 + slot x 8.
