// Screen 25: for each shown controller row checks the player's buttons (picks' layout 0x8051C146) and Start: returns 0x200 when one presses a ready / back button, else -1. No callers in the converted code. (2026-11-14, fablenames2: read line by line and confirmed as named. For each of the four rows from menu row +0x512 (0x88 apart) whose label's low four bits give a controller (1-4): its ready flag is the word at 0x80106450 + row x 4. Not ready and 0x4000 pressed -> ready (sound 0x403, row flag 2 cleared, the count + 0x10); ready and 0x8000 or the shared pad's Start (0x1000) pressed -> not ready (sound 0x413, flag 2 set); ready and 0x4000 pressed -> the result 0x200. With anyone ready the screen's +0x60 is 0x2101, set_vs_card_controller_rows(0) runs when someone became ready this frame, and it returns 0x200 or 25 (this screen); with no one ready +0x60 is 0x2100 and it returns -1. set_vs_card_controller_rows is what ties it to the VS card.)
